sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant FE as Customer FE
  participant O as Cart & Order
  participant Cat as Catalog
  participant L as Promotion
  participant Ship as Shipping
  participant Pay as Payment
  participant Bank as Bank / SePay-Casso
  participant N as Notification
  C->>FE: Chọn món, checkout
  FE->>O: POST /orders/preview
  O->>Cat: Kiểm tra giá & còn món
  O->>L: Validate voucher / điểm
  O->>Ship: Tính phí ship
  FE->>O: POST /orders
  O->>Pay: Tạo payment request
  Pay-->>FE: VietQR + orderCode
  O-->>FE: PENDING_PAYMENT
  C->>Bank: Chuyển khoản thật
  Bank->>Pay: Webhook giao dịch
  Pay->>Pay: Verify signature + match code/amount + idempotency
  Pay-->>O: payment.confirmed
  O->>N: order status changed
  N-->>C: Thông báo đã xác nhận
  alt mismatch hoặc hết hạn
    Pay-->>O: payment.failed
    N-->>C: Thanh toán lỗi / hết hạn
  end
